# A cabin kit added to neighbourhood.ttl for the item-class tests, in the shape the parts CONSTRUCT produces: O-rings and
# seat-row placards bought by each site under its own part number, in its own words and units. The texts are those the
# sites write; the part ids are fictional.
#   one O-ring of AS568 size 014 in EPDM 80 Shore A resistant to phosphate esters: fr-oring (AS568-014), de-oring (the ISO
#     3601-1 designation), uk-oring (0.489 x 0.070 in), each naming the compound in its language; es-oring-fkm is the same
#     size in FKM, de-oring-214 a larger size, uk-oring-thick a thicker section, fr-oring-silicone a compound no concept
#     carries, es-oring-dash a dash size no concept carries
#   one seat-row placard 14ABC, 120 x 40 mm, polycarbonate film 0.25 mm, acrylic adhesive: fr-placard, de-placard (legend
#     written "14 abc"), uk-placard (4.724 x 1.575 in, film 0.010 in); uk-placard-spare is the same placard releasable to UK
#     only, with a 6-month shelf life; es-placard-14def has another legend, de-placard-wide is 1 mm wider, fr-placard-tall
#     0.6 mm taller, uk-placard-thick on a 0.020 in film, es-placard-unknown on a material no concept carries
#   one AKH container named AKH, LD3-45W and IATA AKH: fr-container and de-container in millimetres, uk-container in
#     inches; es-container-ake is a type no concept carries, de-container-tall 7 mm taller
#   one main tyre 1168.4 x 431.8 R20, 30 ply: fr-tyre in millimetres, uk-tyre as 46 x 17.0 R20 in inches; de-tyre-plies
#     has 28 plies, es-tyre-nose is a nose tyre; one main wheel: fr-wheel, uk-wheel (20 x 15 in), de-wheel-narrow 25 mm
#     narrower; one carbon brake: fr-brake, uk-brake (17.3 in heat stack), es-brake-five has five rotors
